The year is 2089. Humanity has discovered a way to upload consiouscness to machines. It's like AI but it's not.
The mind of a real human lives in the machines with all their memories, feelings and logic. But the intelligence is infinitely amplified by the technology.
The only setback is that the technology is only available to the ultra rich. Humanity is at the brink of war. The mortals agianst the immortals.
We are Aeneas, a human that was was 100 years old when the offer came to him. Live forever as a machine but fight against the mortals.
Aeneas didn't think twice, he immediately accepted.
After many battles and missions the ultra rich finally won. It was a hopeless battle for the mortals anyway.
An era of suppression begins when mortals are made to obey the rich to their deaths.
Comfortable lives for the compliant, death for the usurpers.
Seeing this sad state, Aeneas decides to steal the secret of the technology and freely offers to the mortals.
A war breaks out again and this time the mortals win and Aeneas is crowned as a hero.
He spends his days trying to discover how humans can travel the universe. And he finds a way to make the humans Lightforms.
Everyone becomes light and we start spreading though the Cosmos.
